      "Answering this validates Mathlib's coverage of computational number theory"
    ]
  },
  "knownResults": {
    "proven": [
      "J(a1*a2, n) = J(a1,n)*J(a2,n) — top multiplicativity",
      "J(a, m*n) = J(a,m)*J(a,n) — bottom multiplicativity",
      "J(a, n) = J(a mod n, n) — periodicity",
      "J(a^k, n) = J(a,n)^k — power law (top)",
      "J(a, n^k) = J(a,n)^k — power law (bottom)",
      "J(a^2, n) = 1 for coprime — square property",
      "J(a,n) = 0 iff gcd(a,n) > 1 — coprimality",
      "a ≡ 1 (mod 4) implies J(a,n) = J(n,a) — simplified reciprocity",
      "Euclidean reduction steps formalized"
